@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>Email bodies and uploaded attachments are processed in memory and sent to your configured Azure AI services.
    The app does not keep a mailbox or results database. Azure AI services may retain documents, agent responses
    and conversation history according to their service configuration; review tenant retention and access policies.</p>
<p>Work IQ uses the signed-in user's Microsoft 365 permissions. Only submit information you are authorized to
    process. AI output is advisory and must be checked before taking action.</p>
